# Build output
target/
*.class

# Snapshots written by the app into the project root, e.g.
#   JAVA_OPTS=-Djavaview.snapshot=shot.png ./run.sh
# (the README screenshot under docs/ is tracked on purpose)
/*.png

# The npm package's build output: the scaffolder executable and the framework laid out as a
# Maven repository. Both are staged by npm/scripts/build-package.sh and both are carried in the
# published tarball; neither is source, and both would be megabytes of it. The sources next to
# them -- npm/cli.js, npm/package.json, npm/scripts/ -- are tracked.
/npm/bin/
/npm/lib/
/npm/*.tgz

# Editors
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
# Editor-tool state (not project content)
.alma-snapshots/

# The WebView2 loader DLL: fetched by windows-probe/fetch-loader.ps1 and checksum-verified.
# A third-party binary, like the Tailwind standalone binary — staged, not tracked.
/windows-probe/loader/
